onding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nI was annoyed with my friend for not inviting me to his birthday party. Then, I realized he also talks badly about me behind my back to others.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would I ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Anger\nB) Disappointment\nC) Jealousy\nD) Nervousness\nE) Annoyance\nF) Gratitude\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would I feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) I wasn't invited to the birthday party\nB) I found out my friend talks badly about me behind my back\nC) My friend didn't tell me about the party in advance\nD) I am always excluded from parties","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012427785087906032,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0df9aa9dc5a833d92ad","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482399450,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6cc9216a90ec42368da9ff5f7f378ae7"}